- org-ietf-zstd: 251 assertions (JVM) / 173 (nbb). Reference zstd fixtures at levels -1/-3/-9/-19 over nine input shapes, checksum on and off, three window configurations, a >1 MB multi-block file, concatenated and skippable frames, a dictionary frame asserting the refusal; our XXH64 checked against the checksum the reference writes into its own frames; our raw-block frames read by zstd -d and zstd -t. Caught the three mis-remembered-constant bugs in decision item 9.

